        <section class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-7 shadow-xl ring-1 ring-green-900/10 md:p-10"><div class="mb-7"><p class="mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-secondary">Step 1 of 3 · Account setup</p><h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-primary">Create system admin account</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">Enter your district details to get started. You can configure your classroom next.</p></div><div class="mb-7 flex gap-2"><div class="h-2 flex-1 rounded-full bg-primary"></div><div class="h-2 flex-1 rounded-full bg-slate-200"></div><div class="h-2 flex-1 rounded-full bg-slate-200"></div></div><div id="feedback" class="mb-5 hidden rounded-xl border px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold"></div><form id="registration" class="space-y-5" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();nextStep()"><div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_.75fr_1fr]"><label><span class="mb-2 block text-sm font-bold text-slate-700">First name <em class="text-red-600">*</em></span><input required name="first_name" placeholder="Maria" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm outline-none focus:border-green-700 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-green-100"></label><label><span class="mb-2 block text-sm font-bold text-slate-700">Middle initial</span><input name="middle_initial" maxlength="2" placeholder="A." autocomplete="additional-name" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm uppercase outline-none focus:border-green-700 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-green-100"><span class="mt-2 block text-xs text-slate-500">Optional. One letter, with or without a period.</span></label><label><span class="mb-2 block text-sm font-bold text-slate-700">Last name <em class="text-red-600">*</em></span><input required name="last_name" placeholder="Rivera" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm outline-none focus:border-green-700 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-green-100"></label></div><label class="block"><span class="mb-2 block text-sm font-bold text-slate-700">School email <em class="text-red-600">*</em></span><input required type="email" name="email" placeholder="m.rivera@oakmiddle.edu" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm outline-none focus:border-green-700 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-green-100"><span class="mt-2 block text-xs text-slate-400">Use the address connected to your district account.</span></label><label class="block"><span class="mb-2 block text-sm font-bold text-slate-700">School or district <em class="text-red-600">*</em></span><input required name="school" placeholder="Oak Creek Middle School" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm outline-none focus:border-green-700 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-green-100"></label><div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2"><label><span class="mb-2 block text-sm font-bold text-slate-700">Password <em class="text-red-600">*</em></span><div class="relative"><input id="password" required minlength="8" type="password" name="password" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 pr-11 text-sm outline-none focus:border-green-700 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-green-100" oninput="strength(this.value)"><button type="button" class="absolute right-3 top-2.5 text-slate-400" onclick="toggle('password')">◉</button></div><div class="mt-2 flex gap-1"><i id="bar1" class="h-1.5 flex-1 rounded bg-slate-200"></i><i id="bar2" class="h-1.5 flex-1 rounded bg-slate-200"></i><i id="bar3" class="h-1.5 flex-1 rounded bg-slate-200"></i><i id="bar4" class="h-1.5 flex-1 rounded bg-slate-200"></i></div><span id="strength" class="mt-1 block text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-slate-400">Use 8+ characters</span></label><label><span class="mb-2 block text-sm font-bold text-slate-700">Confirm password <em class="text-red-600">*</em></span><input required type="password" name="password_confirmation" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm outline-none focus:border-green-700 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-green-100"></label></div><label class="flex items-start gap-3 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-600"><input required type="checkbox" class="mt-1 accent-green-700"><span>I agree to the CodeQuest <a href="#terms" class="font-bold text-primary underline">Terms of Service</a> and acknowledge the <a href="#privacy" class="font-bold text-primary underline">Privacy Policy</a>.</span></label><button type="submit" class="w-full rounded-xl bg-primary py-3.5 text-sm font-black text-white shadow-[0_4px_0_#022100] transition hover:bg-green-800">Continue to Classroom Setup →</button></form><p class="mt-7 text-center text-sm text-slate-500">Already have an account? <a href="{{ route('teacher.login') }}" class="font-black text-primary hover:underline">Sign in here</a></p><div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 border-t border-slate-200 pt-5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500"><span>✓ FERPA compliant</span><span>✓ COPPA certified</span><span>🔒 District enclave</span></div></section>
